{
  "id": "zoom",
  "label": "Zoom",
  "hint": "Zoom out, explore the schedule, then zoom in for detail.",
  "anchor": "zoom",
  "initial": {
    "view": "preferred",
    "theme": "system",
    "density": 22,
    "zoom": 8,
    "controls": ["zoom"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "find",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 350
    },
    {
      "action": "slider",
      "target": "[data-action=\"zoom\"]",
      "value": 0.5,
      "caption": "Zoom out · see the whole schedule",
      "durationMs": 700,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "scroll",
      "target": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "amount": 900,
      "caption": "Explore the wider view",
      "durationMs": 1000,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 350
    },
    {
      "action": "slider",
      "target": "[data-action=\"zoom\"]",
      "value": 8,
      "caption": "Zoom in · reveal the details",
      "durationMs": 700,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "scroll",
      "target": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "amount": -900,
      "caption": "Explore the detail",
      "durationMs": 1000,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    }
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    "Another concept I consider essential is zoom. You can move quickly into the calendar to see more event details and information.",
    "Use [shift-scroll], or a separate zoom control, to change the level of detail."
  ],
  "loop": "continue"
}
